<h2>Angkudan</h2>
Angkudan.
Saint-Denis dipunlayani déning sekawan stasiun wonten ing &lt;a href="M%C3%A9tro%20de%20Paris%20Jalur%2013"&gt;Métro de Paris Jalur 13&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Carrefour%20Pleyel%20%28M%C3%A9tro%20de%20Paris%29"&gt;Carrefour Pleyel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saint-Denis-Porte%20de%20Paris%20%28M%C3%A9tro%20de%20Paris%29"&gt;Saint-Denis-Porte de Paris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basilique%20de%20Saint-Denis%20%28M%C3%A9tro%20de%20Paris%29"&gt;Basilique de Saint-Denis&lt;/a&gt; (di pusat kutha, dekat &lt;a href="Saint%20Denis%20Basilica"&gt;Saint Denis Basilica&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Saint-Denis-Universit%C3%A9%20%28M%C3%A9tro%20de%20Paris%29"&gt;Saint-Denis-Université&lt;/a&gt;.
Saint-Denis ugi dipunlayani stasiun &lt;a href="La%20Plaine%20%E2%80%93%20Stade%20de%20France%20%28RER%20Paris%29"&gt;La Plaine – Stade de France&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing &lt;a href="RER%20B"&gt;RER jalur B&lt;/a&gt; Paris, ingkang minangka stasiun paling caket kaliyan aréna ulah raga &lt;a href="Stade%20de%20France"&gt;Stade de France&lt;/a&gt;.
Pungkasan, Saint-Denis dipunlayani kalih stasiun wonten ing &lt;a href="RER%20D"&gt;RER jalur D&lt;/a&gt; Paris: &lt;a href="Stade%20de%20France%20%E2%80%93%20Saint-Denis%20%28RER%20Paris%29"&gt;Stade de France – Saint-Denis&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Saint-Denis%20%28SNCF%29"&gt;Saint-Denis&lt;/a&gt;. Stasiun pungkasan, minangka satunggalipun stasiun sepur wonten ing Saint-Denis sadéréng wontenipun Métro lan RER, nglayani ugi minangka stasiun persimpangan kanggé jalur rèl pinggiran &lt;a href="Transilien%20Paris%20%E2%80%93%20Nord"&gt;Transilien Paris – Nord&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kriminalisme</h2>
Kriminalisme.
Saint Denis kondhang wonten ing Perancis kanggé tingkat kriminalismenipun. Kagungan 150.71 kadadosan kriminal saben 1000 pendhudhuk, langkung inggil saking rata-rata nasional 
(83/1000) lan ugi langkung inggil saking kriminalisme departemeè Seine Saint Denis (95.67/1000). Èfisiènsi pulisi kalaporaken andhap sanget, namung 19.82% kriminalisme ingkang dipuntindakaken déning pulisi. Amargi tingkat ingkang inggil punika, kutha punika kènging dampak Haruhara sipil taun 2005.
<h2>Pendidikan</h2>
Pendidikan.
Saint-Denis gadhah 29 publik écoles maternelles. Saint-Denis gadhah 30 publik écoles élémentaires, kanthi salah satunggaling sekolah (École Élémentaire Maria Casarès) dados sekolah antar komuntias. Saint-Denis gadhah 8 publik collèges. Saint-Denis gadhah &lt;a href="Lyc%C3%A9e%20Bartholdi"&gt;Lycée Bartholdi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lyc%C3%A9e%20Paul%20%C3%89luard"&gt;Lycée Paul Éluard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lyc%C3%A9e%20Suger"&gt;Lycée Suger&lt;/a&gt;, lan Lycée d’application de l’E.N.N.A.
Saint-Denis gadhah SD, SMP, lan SMA pribadi (&lt;a href="Ensemble%20scolaire%20Jean-Baptiste%20de%20La%20Salle%20et%20Notre-Dame%20de%20la%20Compassion"&gt;Ensemble scolaire Jean-Baptiste de La Salle et Notre-Dame de la Compassion&lt;/a&gt;) lan satunggal SMA swasta lan pawiyatan luhur (&lt;a href="Coll%C3%A8ge%20et%20lyc%C3%A9e%20Saint-Vincent%20de%20Paul"&gt;Collège et lycée Saint-Vincent de Paul&lt;/a&gt;).
