New Caledonia

New Caledonia (Perancis: Nouvelle Calédonie-) ya iku kolektivitas mirunggan &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; ana ing barat daya &lt;a href="Segara%20Pasifik"&gt;Samudera Pasifik&lt;/a&gt;, 1.210 kilomèter (750 mil) 
wétané &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; lan 16.136 kilomèter (10.026 mil) wétané Perancis Metropolitan. Nusantara, péranganing Melanesia subregional, 
kalebu pulau utama Grande Terre, para Loyalty Islands, para KapuloanChesterfield, para Belep kepulauan, karo Isle of Pines lan pulau sak titik cilik-cilik. 
KapuloanChesterfield ana ing Laut Koral. masyarakate njenengi Grande Terre dadi "Le Caillou", batu. The Chesterfield Islands are in the &lt;a href="Coral%20Sea"&gt;Coral Sea&lt;/a&gt;. Locals refer to Grande Terre as "Le Caillou", the stone.
