<doc id="100571" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=100571" title="Kurt Cobain">
Kurt Cobain

Kurt Donald Cobain (&lt;a href="20%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;20 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1967"&gt;1967&lt;/a&gt; – ± &lt;a href="5%20April"&gt;5 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku penyanyi, pancipta tembang lan gitaris ing band &lt;a href="grunge"&gt;grunge&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Seattle%2C%20Washington"&gt;Seattle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nirvana"&gt;Nirvana&lt;/a&gt;. Amarga misuwure band iki, Cobain dadi selebriti nasional lan internasional.
Ing taun &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;, tembang Cobain kang paling misuwur, &lt;a href="Smells%20Like%20Teen%20Spirit"&gt;Smells Like Teen Spirit&lt;/a&gt;, iku nandani anané owah-owahan gedhé ing musik pop saka aneka warna musik kang misuwur ing taun &lt;a href="1980-an"&gt;1980-an&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="glam%20metal"&gt;glam metal&lt;/a&gt;, arena rock, lan dance-pop, tumuju grunge lan &lt;a href="alternative%20rock"&gt;alternative rock&lt;/a&gt;.
Liyane iku tembang-tembang tulisan Cobain kaya &lt;a href="About%20a%20Girl"&gt;About a Girl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Come%20as%20You%20Are"&gt;Come as You Are&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="In%20Bloom"&gt;In Bloom&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lithium%20%28lagu%29"&gt;Lithium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Heart-Shaped%20Box"&gt;Heart-Shaped Box&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="All%20Apologies"&gt;All Apologies&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Rape%20Me"&gt;Rape Me&lt;/a&gt;.
Cobain krama karo &lt;a href="Courtney%20Love"&gt;Courtney Love&lt;/a&gt; ing tanggal &lt;a href="24%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;24 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Waikiki"&gt;Waikiki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hawaii"&gt;Hawaii&lt;/a&gt;. Ing tanggal &lt;a href="18%20Agustus"&gt;18 Agustus&lt;/a&gt;, 1992, &lt;a href="Frances%20Bean%20Cobain"&gt;Frances Bean Cobain&lt;/a&gt; dilahirake.
Ing tanggal &lt;a href="1%20Maret"&gt;1 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;, sabanjuré konser ing &lt;a href="M%C3%BCnchen"&gt;München&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, Cobain didiagnosa dhuweni &lt;a href="bronchitis"&gt;bronchitis&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="laryngitis"&gt;laryngitis&lt;/a&gt; kang parah. Cobain diterbangake tumuju &lt;a href="Roma"&gt;Roma&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nglampahi pangobatan, lan garwane ing tanggal &lt;a href="3%20Maret"&gt;3 Maret&lt;/a&gt;.
