<doc id="100720" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=100720" title="Abdellatif Kechiche">
Abdellatif Kechiche

Abdellatif Kechiche (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: عبد اللطيف كشيش‎‎, lair 7 Dhésèmber 1960) iku &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sutradhara"&gt;sutradhara&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="penulis%20naskah"&gt;penulis naskah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Tunisia"&gt;Tunisia&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké nglekasi kariré minangka sutradhara uga penulis nalika taun 2000 lumantar filem &lt;a href="La%20Faute%20%C3%A0%20Voltaire"&gt;La Faute à Voltaire&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Blame%20it%20on%20Voltaire"&gt;Blame it on Voltaire&lt;/a&gt;) utawa &lt;a href="Poetical%20Refugee"&gt;Poetical Refugee&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké uga nyutradharai &lt;a href="Games%20of%20Love%20and%20Chance"&gt;Games of Love and Chance&lt;/a&gt; lan menangaké &lt;a href="C%C3%A9sar%20Award"&gt;César Award&lt;/a&gt; kanggo kategori &lt;a href="C%C3%A9sar%20Award%20for%20Best%20Film"&gt;Best Film&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="C%C3%A9sar%20Award%20for%20Best%20Director"&gt;Best Director&lt;/a&gt;. Film besutané liyané, &lt;a href="The%20Secret%20of%20the%20Grain"&gt;The Secret of the Grain&lt;/a&gt; ditayangaké ing &lt;a href="Venice%20Film%20Festival"&gt;64th Mostra del Cinema&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Venesia"&gt;Venesia&lt;/a&gt; lan menangaké Special Jury Prize, &lt;a href="FIPRESCI%20Prize"&gt;FIPRESCI Prize&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Louis%20Delluc%20Prize"&gt;Louis Delluc Prize&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="C%C3%A9sar%20Award"&gt;César Award&lt;/a&gt; kanggo kategori &lt;a href="C%C3%A9sar%20Award%20for%20Best%20Film"&gt;Best Film&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="C%C3%A9sar%20Award%20for%20Best%20Director"&gt;Best Director&lt;/a&gt;.
Minangka aktor, dhèwèké ditepungi ing kalangan penonton abasa Inggris minangka paraga &lt;a href="sopir%20taksi"&gt;sopir taksi&lt;/a&gt; Ashade ing filem psikologi taun 2005 &lt;a href="Sorry%2C%20Haters"&gt;Sorry, Haters&lt;/a&gt;. Film mau dadi "filem pilihan resmi" ing &lt;a href="f%C3%A8stival%20filem"&gt;fèstival filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Toronto%20Film%20Festival"&gt;Toronto&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="American%20Film%20Institute"&gt;American Film Institute&lt;/a&gt;.
Filmé taun 2013, &lt;a href="Blue%20Is%20the%20Warmest%20Colour"&gt;Blue Is the Warmest Colour&lt;/a&gt;, menangaké &lt;a href="Palme%20d%27Or"&gt;Palme d'Or&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="International%20Federation%20of%20Film%20Critics"&gt;FIPRESCI Prize&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Festival%20Film%20Cannes%202013"&gt;Festival Film Cannes 2013&lt;/a&gt;.
