Antoine Kohn

"
Antoine "Spitz" Kohn (1 November 1933&amp;nbsp;– 24 November 2012) iku sawijining juru main lan manajer &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Luxembourg"&gt;Luxembourg&lt;/a&gt;. Kohn main minangka striker, lan suwé main ing klub &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;, lan wusanané dadi manajer ing ing nagara &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;. Kohn uga olèh jejuluk ya iku "Spitz" amarga instingé kanggo nyithak gol.
<h2>International career</h2>
International career.
Kohn miwiti karir ing tim &lt;a href="Tim%20bal-balan%20Luxembourg"&gt;Luxembourg&lt;/a&gt; ing kualifikasi Kajuwaraan Piala Donya sasi September 1953 nglawan &lt;a href="Tim%20bal-balan%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;.
Kohn main ing laladan internasional pungkasan ing September 1965, dikalahaké 2–5 déning &lt;a href="Tim%20Nasional%20Bal-balan%20Yugoslavia"&gt;Yugoslavia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Gol internasional</h3>
Scores and results list Luxembourg's goal tally first.
<h2>Manager career</h2>
Manager career.
After retiring as a player, Kohn became manager at FC Twente in 1972 and clinched runner-up spot in the &lt;a href="Eredivisie"&gt;Eredivisie&lt;/a&gt; in the 1973/1974 season. In May 1975 they reached the &lt;a href="1975%20UEFA%20Cup%20Final"&gt;UEFA Cup Final&lt;/a&gt;, losing 1–5 on aggregate to German side &lt;a href="Borussia%20M%C3%B6nchengladbach"&gt;Borussia Mönchengladbach&lt;/a&gt;.
He moved on to &lt;a href="Go%20Ahead%20Eagles"&gt;Go Ahead Eagles&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="Club%20Brugge"&gt;Club Brugge&lt;/a&gt; before rejoining Twente in the 1982/1983 season, but he could not save them from relegation that year. After 5 rounds in the 1988/1989 season Kohn became the responsible manager at &lt;a href="AFC%20Ajax"&gt;Ajax&lt;/a&gt;, his assistant being &lt;a href="Louis%20van%20Gaal"&gt;Louis van Gaal&lt;/a&gt;.
He finished his career as a scout for &lt;a href="Udinese"&gt;Udinese&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="SC%20Heerenveen"&gt;SC Heerenveen&lt;/a&gt;.
